# Place your built Android APK here as `CediTrack.apk`.
#
# After running `bun run android:sync` and building a signed APK in Android
# Studio (Build → Generate Signed Bundle / APK), copy the resulting file to:
#
#   public/CediTrack.apk
#
# It will then be served at https://<your-site>/CediTrack.apk and the
# "Download Android APK" button on the landing page will work.
